sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App
    participant Disk as accounts.dat
    User->>App: Launch executable
    App->>Disk: fopen rb
    alt File opened
      App->>Disk: fread up to 100 structures
      App->>Disk: fclose
    else Open failed
      App->>App: Continue with empty/current state
    end
    User->>App: Select Exit
    App->>Disk: fopen wb
    alt Save file opens
      App->>Disk: fwrite active records
      App->>Disk: fclose
      App-->>User: Print save success
    else Open failed
      App-->>User: Print save error
    end
